Build Rules for Chitti

- After each code/config change, build and confirm zero errors.
- If errors occur, fix and rebuild until clean.
- Make small, atomic edits with quick build checks.
- Preserve existing indentation and namespaces.
- Validate WPF XAML bindings/named elements after edits.
- Keep dependencies minimal and pinned; avoid unnecessary additions.
- Treat new warnings as actionable; avoid regressing quality.
- Ensure resources (icons, assets) are valid and buildable.
